    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Divide &amp; conquer</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Tree construction</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/construct-binary-tree-from-preorder-and-inorder-traversal/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 105</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Construct Binary Tree from Preorder and Inorder Traversal</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Preorder names each subtree's root first; inorder puts that root between its left and right subtrees. So take the next preorder value as the root, find it in inorder with a hash map, build the left range, then the right range. Each node is created once: O(n) time, O(n) space.</p>\n"
  },
